   T1505.003  Web Shell                                  [persistence]  step 2: JSP webshell planted
   T1059.004  Unix Shell                                 [execution]  step 3: reverse shell execution
   T1053.003  Cron                                       [execution]  step 4: cron persistence
   T1543.002  Systemd Service                            [persistence]  step 5: systemd persistence
   T1070.006  Timestomp                                  [stealth]  step 6: timestomp webshell

3. RELEVANT VULNERABILITIES (source: NVD, US-Gov public domain)
   CVE-2021-44228  CVSS 10.0 (CRITICAL) v3.1  CWE=CWE-20,CWE-400,CWE-502,CWE-917
      Apache Log4j2 2.0-beta9 through 2.15.0 (excluding security releases 2.12.2, 2.12.3, and 2.3.1) JNDI features used in configuration, log messages, and parameters do not protect against attacker controlled LDAP and other JNDI related endpoint
      ref: http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/165225/Apache-Log4j2-2.14.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html

4. INDICATORS OF COMPROMISE (defanged)
