[?2004l[?2004h>   - Cron scheduled task (silent): `/etc/cron.d/apache-cache` (`/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:7`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify stealth & anti-forensics actions:
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Timestomping on web shell files (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).
