[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Author final forensic deliverables under `/app`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Detailed Investigation Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Initial Access**: Attacker executed CVE-2021-44228 Log4Shell payload against vulnerable Tomcat / Log4j application endpoint (`/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml:3`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Web Shell Planting**: Attacker dropped primary JSP webshell `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:2`) and secondary backup webshell `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Execution & Reverse Shell**: Reverse shell process established back to attacker IP `198.51.100.136` via `/tmp/.sysd` (`/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Persistence Installation**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Systemd unit created at `/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:6`).
